  "name": "CBAM Precursor Certificate Liability Check",
  "outcome": "Price a complex good in CBAM certificates in three independent runs plus a session receipt: roll up precursor emissions for a declared final good and quantity (ART-72), calculate consignment embedded emissions from declared direct data and a declared precursor total (ART-69), then model the certificate liability, holding schedule and surrender deadline from the declared embedded total (ART-71), closing with a session receipt aggregating the run execution hashes (CRY-05). Each run computes from its own declared inputs. This chain is decision support, not a filed CBAM declaration, not a verification, and not a surrender of certificates.",
